{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09976","headline":"云中行 · 薛奇童","name":"云中行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云中小儿吹金管，向晚因风一川满。\n塞北云高心已悲，城南木落肠堪断。\n忆昔魏家都此方，凉风观前朝百王。\n千门晓映山川色，双阙遥连日月光。\n举杯称寿永相保，日夕歌钟彻清昊。\n将军汗马百战塲，天子射兽五原草。\n寂寞金舆去不归，陵上黄尘满路飞。\n河边不语伤流水，川上含情叹落晖。\n此时独立无所见，日暮寒风吹客衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛奇童","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}